00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:16.000
if there's too much it might not
actually be fine

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.520
so toxicologists have analyzed the
safety of these ingredients

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.639
based on the amounts that are commonly
used in products

00:06:22.639 --> 00:06:26.880
if you have 75% of something rather than
