00:12:02.639 --> 00:12:06.079
but if you're mixing a single dose of
serum let's say about 0.2 mL which is

00:12:06.079 --> 00:12:08.560
how much i use
you're going to need two milligrams of

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:12.240
